+# 90-161.Z: tasks for the work computer
+
+The same tasks as https://rhope-ops.github.io/90-161.Z, for a computer where github.io is blocked. A Markdown page cannot have buttons, so each round script has one link: **Open the script** (plain text; press Ctrl+A, then Ctrl+C).
+
+On this page, the first steps of a round task are different: write down the **Code** shown under the round (it is the code next to the round on the RADE page), then open the script and copy all of it. Then go on with the step "Open the Start menu".
+
+<!-- >>> tasks: generated from go.md by scripts/build_readme.py (do not edit) -->
+<!-- <<< tasks -->
